    pedagogy: 'Start from the text, not from a lecture on Sûfîsm. Learners box the definition, then prove every idea with a quoted phrase. Grammar is discovered, not presented: you ask “What does a Sûfî want? How?” and learners find that “by + -ing” answers “How?” before you name the rule.',
