    lessonPlan: '0–5 Hook: “Sûfî” on the board, pairs write one question for the chapter, three are kept on the board; 5–13 Listen with books closed for gist (which question was answered?), then read along and box the definition; 13–20 Pairs sort outer worship / inner intention and morality, every item with a quoted phrase, quick whole-class check; 20–24 Quick Challenge individually; 24–32 Language Focus: Activity 1 as whole-class discovery (What does a Sûfî want? How?), Activities 2–3 in pairs while you monitor the -ing list; 32–38 Use: learners draft five sentences about a teacher, artist or community figure (a person who … aims to … by …-ing), two volunteers read and the class names the aim and the method; 38–40 Exit ticket.',
