    pedagogy: 'The chapter has two paragraphs with two different jobs: the first adds functions of the tekkes, the second builds a chain of causes. A jigsaw makes this visible: half the class becomes experts on each paragraph and teaches the other half. Learners then discover that the linking words themselves (furthermore, too, especially / weakened by, caused, because of) show the job of each paragraph.',
