    afterReading: ['Complete the Quick Challenge with one function and one context detail.', 'Language Focus: sort adding vs cause sentences, then choose the background/event forms and rephrase the causes.', 'Compare two functions of a modern community institution without claiming it solves every problem.'],
    lessonPlan: '0–5 Hook: Tekkés hotspot image, class mind map of predictions; 5–12 Whole-class listening, then split: half the class studies paragraph 1 (functions), half paragraph 2 (cause chain); 12–20 Jigsaw: A–B pairs teach each other their paragraph with one quoted sentence each, then check the mind map against the text; 20–24 Quick Challenge; 24–32 Language Focus: Activity 1 in the same A–B pairs (they already know one paragraph each), Activities 2–3 individually; 32–38 Use: pairs compare two functions of a modern community centre, library or charity, one while-sentence required; 38–40 Exit ticket.',
