    differentiation: { strugglingLearners: 'Give two boxes (functions / problems) and the frames “Tekkes were not only ____. They were also ____.” and “While ____ were still ____, ____ took place.”', fastFinishers: 'Write a six-sentence explanation connecting three functions with two historical pressures using at least three different linking words.' },
