    lessonPlan: 'Lesson 1 (40 min): 0–5 Predict the order of three event cards; 5–15 Listen with books closed and number the events, then read to check; 15–25 Map task in pairs: mark Erzurum, Kösedağ, Sivas, Kayseri and Erzincan with the year and one verb from the text; 25–32 Expectation vs reality T-chart: “They believed …” / “In the end …”, with evidence; 32–37 Quick Challenge; 37–40 Bridge sentence naming one consequence; Lesson 2 (40 min): 0–4 Retrieve the map orally; 4–12 Language Focus Activity 1 as whole-class discovery (Did the leaders save them?); 12–22 Activities 2–3 in pairs, then learners explain the difference between because and because of with their own examples; 22–33 Use: a calm “chronicle” of a real or school event (because …, however, caused, thus), no dramatic language; 33–38 Peer check: underline every linker and check that each expectation is marked as an expectation; 38–40 Exit ticket.',
