    pedagogy: 'Lesson 1 handles the sensitive first paragraph calmly (the teacher reads it once, without lingering) and then builds a “staircase of dependence” from the second paragraph. Lesson 2 asks why so many sentences start with the people or lands that suffered: learners sort active and passive sentences and discover that the passive keeps the victims in focus.',
